WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.047
Meet DocMosaic.

2
00:00:02.047 --> 00:00:05.213
Agentic document understanding, powered by DocPilot.

3
00:00:05.213 --> 00:00:08.092
Work across text, tables, and figures

4
00:00:08.092 --> 00:00:12.697
to turn complex documents into answers you can inspect.

5
00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:16.993
Let an agent solve the task.

6
00:00:16.993 --> 00:00:18.353
Explore the evidence.

7
00:00:18.353 --> 00:00:21.601
Then teach those capabilities to a compact model.

8
00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:23.506
First.

9
00:00:23.506 --> 00:00:25.769
Agentic document understanding.

10
00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:30.829
Doc Mosaic turns complex documents into grounded answers.

11
00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:36.867
An agent locates financial evidence across Nike's annual report.

12
00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:45.856
Extract cost of sales and inventory. Keep every value linked to its source.

13
00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:52.305
Generate Python from the evidence. Execute the code.

14
00:00:53.800 --> 00:00:55.824
Three point four six times.

15
00:00:57.300 --> 00:01:02.715
Verify the evidence and calculation. Return a grounded answer.

16
00:01:03.700 --> 00:01:04.542
Second.

17
00:01:04.542 --> 00:01:06.963
Make the evidence explorable.

18
00:01:07.800 --> 00:01:11.093
Doc Mosaic makes the path to an answer visible.

19
00:01:12.600 --> 00:01:16.216
A paper plane follows the agent through Nike's report.

20
00:01:18.300 --> 00:01:23.759
Page fifty nine. Cost of sales, captured as evidence E three.

21
00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:31.560
Page sixty one. Inventory balances become evidence E four.

22
00:01:32.800 --> 00:01:38.621
The calculation uses both sources. Every input stays connected.

23
00:01:39.400 --> 00:01:46.251
Follow a citation back to the original page. See exactly what supports the answer.

24
00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:50.818
A clear answer. A visible evidence trail.

25
00:01:51.700 --> 00:01:52.429
Third.

26
00:01:52.429 --> 00:01:55.891
From large language models to small ones.

27
00:01:56.900 --> 00:01:59.465
DocPilot first trains individual skills,

28
00:01:59.465 --> 00:02:03.364
using thirty five thousand focused reasoning traces.

29
00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:08.168
Then, five thousand interaction traces teach the model

30
00:02:08.168 --> 00:02:11.574
to select and combine skills as evidence changes.

31
00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:18.115
Against the same four billion parameter base model,

32
00:02:18.115 --> 00:02:22.397
gains are four point two, seven point five, and eleven points

33
00:02:22.397 --> 00:02:24.188
across these three benchmarks.

34
00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:31.856
Across all three benchmarks,

35
00:02:31.856 --> 00:02:36.774
DocPilot four B outperforms vanilla Gemini two point five Pro.

36
00:02:36.774 --> 00:02:41.692
On DocBench, it nearly matches Gemini three point one Pro.

37
00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:46.102
DocMosaic.

38
00:02:46.102 --> 00:02:50.650
Understand documents, and inspect the reasoning.
